    { math: '2 · Constraints choose you', note: 'Your medium, subject obsession and hand-motor habits (the flick of your wrist, your natural line weight) form a fingerprint no effort erases. Working WITH your constraints (leaning into them) reads as authenticity; fighting them reads as strain.' },
